{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2025-07", "window": 4, "start_date": 1753315200, "end_date": 1754006399, "month_true_total": 88, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:01:55 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "201174822", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025376299", "personaname": "LordGirugamesh", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198025376299/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 428, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 416, "last_played": 1754003971, "avatar": "1207d1ec909b2b0c4721f1bbdf898427b80e665c"}, "language": "english", "review": "This was a pure mistake for a Mass Effect game, completely doing a 180 on the whole franchise especially since this is just Dragon Age Inquisition but in space, can't help that 50% of the world's populace had to deal with crashes and bugs left and right.", "timestamp_created": 1754004254, "timestamp_updated": 1754004254, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201150581", "author": {"steamid": "76561198212821644", "personaname": "WHSolvation", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/whsolvation/", "num_games_owned": 597, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 494, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 494, "last_played": 1665245839, "avatar": "121499c50cb0010bd835b84c59761b5ff4a4c666"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a bad Mass Effect game. I couldn't make myself go through even half of the campaign (tried it twice), that's how blunt its story and characters are. If you are looking for Mass Effect experience, stick to the first 3 parts for now.", "timestamp_created": 1753978125, "timestamp_updated": 1753978125, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.493224918842315674", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201132325", "author": {"steamid": "76561198140060380", "personaname": "MethHeadLarry", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Exttazzy/", "num_games_owned": 385, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 3614, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2909, "last_played": 1754397872, "avatar": "eec841232bae5d0e438e93549abcc7708195bea7"}, "language": "english", "review": "A very good game but not a very good Mass Effect game, I think BioWare should've named this game as something else, would've had alot better reception + people wouldn't have been so hyped about this game. Also modding this game is extremely easy.", "timestamp_created": 1753958994, "timestamp_updated": 1753958994, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201065034", "author": {"steamid": "76561198273112642", "personaname": "missnukarat", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/missnukarat/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2153, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1950, "last_played": 1753910982, "avatar": "5d3e2d334727db207afecbaa03169acba510562c"}, "language": "english", "review": "reyes vidal", "timestamp_created": 1753879686, "timestamp_updated": 1753879686, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.527559041976928711", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201057723", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017680813", "personaname": "YodaWeissmuller", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017680813/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 4246, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4246, "last_played": 1717787904, "avatar": "4fbe328895ef92ce5ce53727152f7ad175420772"}, "language": "english", "review": "Overall, the game is an enjoyable experience despite all of its shortcomings. The gameplay alone makes it worthwile with the freedom it gives you in both bulding your skills and in combat itself. Everything else (setting, story, characters and performances) is unfortunately of a lower quality than the original trilogy, but to be honest, when compared to similar games these days rather than some of the best RPGs ever made, it is servicable, and has its moments. I didn't fall in love with it the way I did with the trilogy, but I don't regret playing through Andromeda a couple of times.", "timestamp_created": 1753871500, "timestamp_updated": 1753871500, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 9, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.610698044300079346", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}